  step,dige:4d8d5b4a1abafbd1
  step=2,dige:d516aa5f8f793f5e,desc:seed the orchestra — a stuffed band beside three kin songs and two loose strays
  step=3,dige:9d653dccb345c38e,desc:commission the glass foam-cut and nested — six top cells with the band carrying three
  step=4,dige:273be0d36aabc6f8,desc:read the weave — flow among the kin songs and none touching the strays
  step=5,dige:8f4ac83722ee3aae,desc:give two songs a shared mood — the weave must deepen live
  step=6,dige:fcfc2bc9fa471ba2,desc:focus one song — its cell must swell while an off-focus sibling compresses
  step=7,dige:6e84329fdb0df98b,desc:re-pose the commission — drop a stray and admit a pull
  step=8,dige:82ecf0af2b793167,desc:drop the drummer — the escort marks one stir then the row leaves the bag
